WEBVTT

00:01.120 --> 00:02.520
I'm fine.

00:10.440 --> 00:11.840
Still not leaving?

00:13.480 --> 00:15.480
Want me to see you out?

00:15.720 --> 00:18.240
Your Majesty, forgive me I'll leave now.

00:21.520 --> 00:25.120
By the way there's one more thing commissioned by Chancellor Xie.

00:25.640 --> 00:30.320
Says there are state matters to discuss with Your Majesty asked me to inform Your Majesty.

00:38.640 --> 00:41.000
Your Majesty state affairs come first.

00:44.600 --> 00:47.880
I know have him wait for me at the Imperial Administration Palace.

00:47.960 --> 00:49.080
Yes.

